        },
        {
          "text": "Umwami w’i Aradi w’Umunyakanani, wo mu gihugu c’i Negebu, yumva kw Abisirayeli baje bazananye inzira itumbereye Atarimu, arabarwanya, afata mpiri bamwe muri bo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.21.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.21.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
